From: Sergio Ponguta <sergioponguta@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:46:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kovalla): filter streams with a quality chip row

A second row under the addon chips (All, 4K, 1080p, 720p, SD, Unknown) filters the
source list by resolution, also when the addon chip is All. Only the tiers present for
the selected addon are shown, and the row is hidden when there is a single tier.
